  "details": "For the past week or so, there's been a very annoying issue regarding keyboards, where upon pressing a key, the entire prompt gets highlighted at random which of course can get overwritten if another key is pressed. \n\nThis affects any text prompt in the game, from statuses, invite messages, and even prompts in worlds.\n\nI've only tested this using a Quest 2 linked to PC, so I am unsure if this is hardware specific.",
